,{"kind":"508","justification":"515"},{"kind":"508","justification":"516"},{"kind":"508","justification":"517"},{"kind":"508","justification":"518"},{"kind":"508","justification":"519"},{"kind":"508","justification":"517"},{"kind":"508","justification":"519"},{"kind":"508","justification":"520"},{"kind":"508","justification":"521"},{"kind":"508","justification":"522"},{"kind":"508","justification":"523"},{"kind":"508","justification":"523"},{"kind":"508","justification":"519"},"directive","inline SVG tile in design system; next/image wraps and breaks .ed-img sizing","design CSS sizes the raw SVG via .ft-orca","design CSS sizes the raw SVG; next/image would inject a wrapper that breaks .hd-logo","design CSS sizes the raw SVG via .rail-img","design CSS sizes the raw SVG via .modesw-orca; next/image overlays a wrapper that breaks the segmented control.","design CSS sizes the raw SVG directly","modal needs arrow/Enter/Esc key handling","keyboard navigation is handled at the combobox input level via arrow keys; options are reached via aria-activedescendant, not focus","raw SVG sized by .perm-orca","modal dialog needs Esc/Tab/⌘Enter key handling","","local BFF returns a size-capped data URL preview","raw SVG sized by .twin-orca","design CSS sizes raw SVG via .pl-img; next/image breaks sizing","design CSS sizes raw SVG via .fi-img; next/image breaks sizing"]